- Added Google conditional access settings (Fleet Premium): admins can connect Fleet to Google by entering the Google customer ID and admin email and uploading the customer's service account key with the new `POST /api/v1/fleet/conditional_access/google` endpoint. Fleet checks the domain-wide delegation with Google and stores the key encrypted. `GET` returns the connection status and `DELETE` removes the integration. GitOps manages `integrations.google_conditional_access` (`customer_id`, `admin_email`), and removing it from YAML turns the integration off; the key is never in YAML.
